{"id":16551,"author":"BoldAndBrash","body":"Basically, you should be able to tag players by typing \"@Username101.\" This would send an alert to the person saying they've been tagged. This way, replies could be much more easier for AMA's, LFM posts, etc.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eExample:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e@Username101 I don't think that's allowed.\u003cbr\u003e@Random8382 Sorry about that\u003cbr\u003e@Name77 Sure!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e^ It would send an alert to all 3 of them.","body_tagged":"Basically, you should be able to tag players by typing \"@Username101.\" This would send an alert to the person saying they've been tagged. This way, replies could be much more easier for AMA's, LFM posts, etc.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eExample:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e@Username101 I don't think that's allowed.\u003cbr\u003e@Random8382 Sorry about that\u003cbr\u003e@Name77 Sure!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e^ It would send an alert to all 3 of them.","created_at":1442069362,"title":"[SUG]  Tagging","replies":[{"id":229017,"author":"jracer15","body":"+1","body_tagged":"+1","created_at":1442069410},{"id":229018,"author":"faht","body":"Yes please","body_tagged":"Yes please","created_at":1442069526},{"id":229029,"author":"DaFrozenBlaze","body":"Has been suggested before, but people will abuse it by spamming it.","body_tagged":"Has been suggested before, but people will abuse it by spamming it.","created_at":1442070373},{"id":229030,"author":"kycrafft","body":"And why does it matter if they spam it? It just gives you more alerts.","body_tagged":"And why does it matter if they spam it? It just gives you more alerts.","created_at":1442070441,"reply_to":229029},{"id":229033,"author":"faht","body":"Then they will be punished. Nothing big to deal with.","body_tagged":"Then they will be punished. Nothing big to deal with.","created_at":1442070462,"reply_to":229029},{"id":229034,"author":"AtditC","body":"Simply update the rules and everyone which will spam it can get banned easily. That the people will abuse this is the not a big problem imo.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e@OP, a big +1 (bigger than the other +1's)","body_tagged":"Simply update the rules and everyone which will spam it can get banned easily. That the people will abuse this is the not a big problem imo.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e@OP, a big +1 (bigger than the other +1's)","created_at":1442070486,"reply_to":229029},{"id":229036,"author":"Robin_DD_J","body":"Maybe you could turn certain notifications on and off?","body_tagged":"Maybe you could turn certain notifications on and off?","created_at":1442070651,"reply_to":229033},{"id":229037,"author":"faht","body":"Yea, good idea.","body_tagged":"Yea, good idea.","created_at":1442070726,"reply_to":229036},{"id":229048,"author":"AutoHit","body":"I think replies are fine now. But like Robin said, being able to turn notification on and off would be helpful.","body_tagged":"I think replies are fine now. But like Robin said, being able to turn notification on and off would be helpful.","created_at":1442074703},{"id":229078,"author":"Coco_stag","body":"I don't really like this idea.......\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI FKING LOVE THIS IDEA","body_tagged":"I don't really like this idea.......\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI FKING LOVE THIS IDEA","created_at":1442089142},{"id":229223,"author":"Coco_stag","body":"Would it work like this?\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"row-fluid\" style=\"width: 869.984375px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"span1\" style=\"